      "001111 00000 fffff ssssssssssssssss",
      "beq $t1,$t2,label",
      "Branch on equal : Branches to 'label' if $t1 == $t2. Uses a PC-relative 16-bit signed offset (multiplied by 4) so the target must be within \xB132 KB. Commonly the first half of an if/else test.",
      "000100 fffff sssss tttttttttttttttt",
      "bne $t1,$t2,label",
